{"id":"6ae5978eb27da451","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-higher-order-fibration.md","title":"高阶纤维化","display":"df-higher-order-fibration — 高阶纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-higher-order-fibration","aliases":["16-df-higher-order-fibration","Higher-order fibration"],"display":"df-higher-order-fibration — 高阶纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","[[16-df-generic-object]]"],"source":"Definition 5.3.1, p. 330 (PDF 350)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-higher-order-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-higher-order-fibration</span><span>Higher-order fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-higher-order-fibration — 高阶纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 5.3.1, p. 330 (PDF 350)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化；一阶结构、CCC、泛对象分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{HOFib}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}higher\\text{-}order\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{HOFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land(\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}higher\\text{-}order\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{HOFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land(\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>逻辑的命题对象是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=pG\">\\(\\Omega=pG\\)</span>；真正的泛谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 位于总范畴。</li>\n<li>本书非分裂版本只要求对象同构分类，不把它强化为纤维对象集合与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(I,\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(I,\\Omega)\\)</span> 的严格双射。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 5.3.1, p. 330 (PDF 350)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-generic-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；一阶结构、CCC、泛对象分别见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；一阶结构、CCC、泛对象分别见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；一阶结构、CCC、泛对象分别见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOFib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-generic-object]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HOFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}higher\\text{-}order\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{HOFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land(\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega=pG","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(I,\\Omega)","display":false}],"bytes":1579,"backlinks":[{"id":"43fd34bb91369415","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HOFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]；$\\mathrm{HOFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是本页定义的旧拼写。"},{"id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8cc0e0e038ae9b87","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为候选范畴；$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]。在有限极限存在的分支中，$p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathcal E$ 使用 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]]。$\\mathrm{HOFib}$、$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]。"},{"id":"0632c91c845f3662","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"高阶结构及任意集合函数的量词换基见 [[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["66d3058a6ae62dc5","18a4c8ba03fadf06","f600e95377e8cbf9"]}